  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peace and Community Cohesion Project Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the reduction and mitigation of community level conflict and insecurity by investing in initiatives that address key drivers of conflict and insecurity. The project also strengthens community relationships by identifying and strengthening cultural, social and economic connectors that make communities reliant on each other in times of peace and conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
